    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T LET HELL CONSUME OUR UNIVERSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to control unknow supernatural forces, Dr.Ashford newest invention ends by trapping his daugther Sarah, and using her as a Human Katalysator to bring hell on Earth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an ancient evil threatens the orderly chaos of the universe, Dr.Ashford hires someone to fight against the endless horde of demons: Raven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/b41e48eff0f02a43f454884bc2d4eb61.avif?t=1752605757\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raven and his allies will have much work from now on, they need to Reproduce and Capture 6 Elemental Powers: Light, Fire, Shadow, Uranium, Ice and Eletricity in order to open the gate to Hell and save Sarah. (and of course, the universe!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/f0db6ae60d1a16ad0970b7794f8589c0.avif?t=1752605757\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> ENDLESS CARNAGE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of the universe is in your hands, so you don't need to play fair:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; The enemies will get stronger, and so will you. Have fun with ENDLESS UPGRADES. That's right! Any upgrade you make on your character attribute or gun can be re-upgraded endlessly, (of course, if you manage to buy them all)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Every map (level) have it's own Main Quest, and each one of them has a Katalysator Elemental Power for you to unlock (and bring it to Dr.Ashford, of course.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Discover Secret Side Quests that rewards you with unique and special weapons, powers, new map areas and much more: Espectral Staffs, Magic Bows, Revolvers forged by demon blood, and much, MUCH MORE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/e39a4a3a513429e42cc5eb99071094ba.avif?t=1752605757\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T LET HELL CONSUME OUR UNIVERSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to control unknow supernatural forces, Dr.Ashford newest invention ends by trapping his daugther Sarah, and using her as a Human Katalysator to bring hell on Earth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an ancient evil threatens the orderly chaos of the universe, Dr.Ashford hires someone to fight against the endless horde of demons: Raven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/b41e48eff0f02a43f454884bc2d4eb61.avif?t=1752605757\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raven and his allies will have much work from now on, they need to Reproduce and Capture 6 Elemental Powers: Light, Fire, Shadow, Uranium, Ice and Eletricity in order to open the gate to Hell and save Sarah. (and of course, the universe!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/f0db6ae60d1a16ad0970b7794f8589c0.avif?t=1752605757\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> ENDLESS CARNAGE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of the universe is in your hands, so you don't need to play fair:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; The enemies will get stronger, and so will you. Have fun with ENDLESS UPGRADES. That's right! Any upgrade you make on your character attribute or gun can be re-upgraded endlessly, (of course, if you manage to buy them all)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Every map (level) have it's own Main Quest, and each one of them has a Katalysator Elemental Power for you to unlock (and bring it to Dr.Ashford, of course.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Discover Secret Side Quests that rewards you with unique and special weapons, powers, new map areas and much more: Espectral Staffs, Magic Bows, Revolvers forged by demon blood, and much, MUCH MORE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/e39a4a3a513429e42cc5eb99071094ba.avif?t=1752605757\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p>",
